  ok  session  inside a Wayland session (wayland-1) that uwsm manages: wayland-wm@hyprland.desktop.service is running

`uwsm stop` ends this session the clean way: every window closes, and anything unsaved
in them is lost. the login screen comes back, and the next login starts generation 0001.
